SENTENCE : s.

Oxford      : np                   = 'Oxford'.
Harvard     : np                   = 'Harvard'.
Mit         : np                   = 'MIT'.
Stanford    : np                   = 'Stanford'.
Columbia    : np                   = 'Columbia'.
Eth         : np                   = 'ETH'.
Epfl        : np                   = 'EPFL'.

Maria      : np        = 'Maria'.
Teodora    : np        = 'Teodora'.
Villads    : np        = 'Villads'.
Eva        : np        = 'Eva'.
Ioana      : np        = 'Ioana'.
Luxin      : np        = 'Luxin'.
Nadia      : np        = 'Nadia'.
Hugo       : np        = 'Hugo'.
Tom        : np        = 'Tom'.
Sarah      : np        = 'Sarah'.

Functional  : np       = 'Functional Programming'.
Statistics  : np       = 'Statistics'.
Compilers   : np       = 'Compilers'.
Analysis    : np       = 'Analysis'.
Algebra     : np       = 'Algebra'.


Entity       : n       = lambda x : x in entities.
Student      : n       = lambda x : x in students.
University   : n       = lambda x : kind[x] == 'university'.
Course       : n       = lambda x : kind[x] == 'course'.


Studies  : np \ (s / np)        = lambda x : lambda y : (x,y) in studies.
Failed   : np \ (s / np)        = lambda x : lambda y : (x,y) in failed.
Passed   : np \ (s / np)        = lambda x : lambda y : (x,y) in passed.
Attends  : np \ (s / np)        = lambda x : lambda y : (x,y) in attends.
Aced     : np \ (s / np)        = lambda x : lambda y : (x,y) in aced.

Graduates      : np \ s         = lambda x : x in graduates.
Works          : np \ s         = lambda x : x in works.


Is            : np \ (s / adj)       = lambda x : lambda p : p(x).

Easy          : adj                  = lambda x : x in easy.
Easy          : n / n                = lambda p : lambda x : p(x) and x in easy.
Challenging   : adj                  = lambda x : x in challenging.
Challenging   : n / n                = lambda p : lambda x : p(x) and x in challenging.

Smart         : adj                  = lambda x : x in smart.
Smart         : n / n                = lambda p : lambda x : p(x) and x in smart.
Tired         : adj                  = lambda x : x in tired.
Tired         : n / n                = lambda p : lambda x : p(x) and x in tired.
Freshman      : adj                  = lambda x : x in first_year.
Freshman      : n / n                = lambda p : lambda x : p(x) and x in first_year.
Senior        : adj                  = lambda x : x in final_year.
Senior        : n / n                = lambda p : lambda x : p(x) and x in final_year.

Selective     : adj                  = lambda x : x in selective.
Selective     : n / n                = lambda p : lambda x : p(x) and x in selective.
Expensive     : adj                  = lambda x : x in expensive.
Expensive     : n / n                = lambda p : lambda x : p(x) and x in expensive.


Someone  : s / (np \ s)         = lambda p : any (p(x) for x in entities).
Someone  : (s / np) \ s         = lambda p : any (p(x) for x in entities).
Every    : (s / (np \ s)) / n   = lambda q : lambda p : all (p(x) for x in entities if q(x)).
Every    : ((s / np) \ s) / n   = lambda q : lambda p : all (p(x) for x in entities if q(x)).
A        : (s / (np \ s)) / n   = lambda q : lambda p : any (p(x) and q(x) for x in entities).
A        : ((s / np) \ s) / n   = lambda q : lambda p : any (p(x) and q(x) for x in entities).

And      : s \ (s / s)          = lambda x : lambda y : x and y.
And      : adj \ (adj / adj)    = lambda p : lambda q : lambda x : p(x) and q(x).

Graduate : cmd / np             = graduate.
Enroll   : cmd / np             = enroll.
Advance  : cmd / np             = advance.

Who      : s / (np \ s)         = lambda p: [x for x in people if p(x)].
Which    : (s / (np \ s)) / n   = lambda n: lambda p: [x for x in entities if n(x) and p(x)].
